ierro</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Brighina</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Amicol</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Evoked potential study and radiological findings in patients with systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title><source>Electromyogr Clin Neurophysiol</source><year>1999</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>305</fpage><lpage>313</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10422001</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b24-ijgm-4-325"><label>24.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Khedr</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Khedr</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Farweez</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Multimodal electroneurophysiological studies of systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title><source>Neuropsychobiology</source><year>2001</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>204</fpage><lpage>212</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11287801</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b25-ijgm-4-325"><label>25.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hanly</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neuropsychiatric Lupus</article-title><source>Rheum Dis Clin N Am</source><year>2005</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>298</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="b26-ijgm-4-325"><label>26.</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Omdal</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Loseth</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Torbergsen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Peripheral neuropathy in systemic lupus erythematosus: a longitudinal study</article-